frontend: build without SDL for the X7 Game (R36SX) port

With NO_SDL the menu reads its buttons from the port (port_menu_keys(),
port_menu_keys_reset()) instead of SDL key events. With R36SX: title
"pcsx4all 2.4 for X7 Game", a button hint line, "Quit to game list", and no
"NTSC Resolution Fix" item (it only affects hardware scaling).
